Mercedes-Benz GLS 2026 Price, Features, Images, Specs ...In Mercedes-Benz nomenclature, GLS stands for Geländewagen (German for off-road vehicle) + Link to the S-Class, signifying it as the S-Class equivalent in the full-size luxury SUV lineup, replacing the older GL-Class. The "G" nods to the iconic G-Class, while the "S" denotes its flagship status, offering top-tier luxury, space, and technology. 
Breakdown of the Name:
G: Denotes it's a Geländewagen (off-road vehicle), linking it to the G-Class heritage.
L: Acts as a bridge, connecting it to Mercedes' core sedan range.
S: Indicates its position as the equivalent of the prestigious S-Class, the brand's flagship sedan. 
In essence, the GLS is Mercedes-Benz's largest, most luxurious, and most technologically advanced SUV, offering S-Class levels of comfort and features in an SUV body. 